    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mota of Latex - Corruption Journey in Another World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor of the Demon Tower brims with temptation and peril. Within, latex and tentacle creatures seek to assimilate them into eternal slaves. Only by relying on one another can they barely maintain their sanity\u2014but as their corruption levels rise, their willpower begins to collapse\u2026 and they may even turn their desires toward each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/835c2e7a1588bd3ecabb9ca8d525c9fd.poster.avif?t=1754665002\" width=548 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/835c2e7a1588bd3ecabb9ca8d525c9fd.webm?t=1754665002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/835c2e7a1588bd3ecabb9ca8d525c9fd.mp4?t=1754665002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Tower (Roguelike Tower Adventure)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will explore a multi-layered otherworldly demon tower\uff0cwhere each floor features procedurally generated rooms\uff0cenemies and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/64cae350d2acdbaf1ef0bf4000478b5a.poster.avif?t=1754665002\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/64cae350d2acdbaf1ef0bf4000478b5a.webm?t=1754665002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Latex outfits and tentacle-related items serve as both gear and tools of discipline\uff0c enhancing attributes while increasing corruption levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/a033178594b1752c8911cc51614ae593.poster.avif?t=1754665002\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/a033178594b1752c8911cc51614ae593.webm?t=1754665002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/a033178594b1752c8911cc51614ae593.mp4?t=1754665002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor contains tentacle traps\uff0clatex-sealed chambers, or NPC temptations that influence character status and story progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
